- The bearer has the following ability: ANGEL&apos;S GRACE (AURA): While a friendly HOUSE HAWKSHROUD ARMIGER-CLASS model is within 6&quot; of the bearer, each time that ARMIGER-CLASS model would lose a wound as the result of a mortal wound, roll on D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost</characteristic>
