          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">AURIC MASK (AURA): While an enemy units is within 12&quot; of this bearer, subtract 1 from the Leadership characteristic of models in that units. While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, subtract an additional 1 from the Leadership characteristic of model in that unit (for a total modifier of -2 leadership) and each time a Combat Attrition test is take for that unit, subtract 1 from the Combat Attrition test.</characteristic>
