          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Replaces the bearer&apos;s Reaper Chainsword. Each time the bearer fights, it makes one additional attack with this weapon. Each time an attack is made with this weapon, select one of the profiles below to make an attack with.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
