      <profiles>
        <profile name="Exalted Court: Master of Justice" id="eadf-5344-3592-3ae6" hidden="false" typeId="dd7a-3f18-28cd-2000" typeName="Exalted Court">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="ae8b-ffea-6d0e-8bc6">When you select this upgrade, select one Questor Imperialis Martial Tradition that no model in your army has (you cannot select Glorified History) -- this model gain that Martial Tradition in addition to any other it has</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Noble Exemplar ability" typeId="712b-eaec-1af0-e425">Once per battle, when you use and Imperial Knights Strategic Ploy Stratagem, if the model you select to use that Strategic Ploy is under the effects of this model&apos;s Bondsman ability, then that Stratagem costs 0 Command Points</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Crusade Duty" typeId="bcbb-2bc1-7507-3852">If this model is in your Crusade force, at the end of the battle, if you won, roll one D6; on a 4+, you gain 1 additional Requisition Point</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
