        <profile name="Exalted Court: High Monarch" id="c9e0-7572-e528-01dc" hidden="false" typeId="dd7a-3f18-28cd-2000" typeName="Exalted Court">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="ae8b-ffea-6d0e-8bc6">If this model is included in your army, it must be your WARLORD. If more than one model in your army has a rule to this effect, then one of the models must be your army&apos;s WARLORD

Each time your army gains an Honour point, roll one D6; on a 5+, you gain 1 additional Honour point</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Noble Exemplar ability" typeId="712b-eaec-1af0-e425">Each time this model uses it&apos;s Bondsman ability, it also applies to every friendly &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; ARMIGER-CLASS model within 6&quot; of this model</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Crusade Duty" typeId="bcbb-2bc1-7507-3852">While this model is in your Crusade Force, each time you use the Exalted Court Requisition, it costs 1 fewer Requisition points to use</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
