          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="ae8b-ffea-6d0e-8bc6">Each time a friendly &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; model uses a Bondsman ability, if they are within 9&quot; of this Herald, they can select one &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; ARMIGER-CLASS model that is within 9&quot; of this Herald for that Bondsman ability to apply to</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Noble Exemplar ability" typeId="712b-eaec-1af0-e425">While an ARMIGER-CLASS model is under the effects of this model&apos;s Bondsman ability, that ARMIGER-CLASS model has a 4+ invulnerable save</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Crusade Duty" typeId="bcbb-2bc1-7507-3852">While this model is in your Crusade Force, each time you use the Specialist Reinforcement or the Warlord Trait Requisition, it costs 1 fewer Requisition points to use</characteristic>
