          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="ae8b-ffea-6d0e-8bc6">If this model is included in your army, it must be your WARLORD. If more than one model in your army has a rule to this effect, then one of those models must be your army&apos;s WARLORD

Each time your army would lost an Honour point, roll a D6; on a 5+, the Honour point is not lost</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Noble Exemplar ability" typeId="712b-eaec-1af0-e425">Once per Command phase, when this model uses its Bondsman ability, it can select a &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; QUESTORIS-CLASS model (excluding itself) for that ability to apply to instead of an ARMIGER-CLASS model</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Crusade Duty" typeId="bcbb-2bc1-7507-3852">While this model is in your Crusade force, each time you use the Exalted Court Requisition, it costs 1 fewer Requisition points to use</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
