      <profiles>
        <profile name="Exalted Court: Forge Master" id="de29-94f2-a3c6-9bd9" hidden="false" typeId="dd7a-3f18-28cd-2000" typeName="Exalted Court">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="ae8b-ffea-6d0e-8bc6">While this model is wholly within your deployment zone, each time a wound is allocated to it, reduce the Damage characteristic of that attack by 1 (to a minimum of 1). This is not cumulative with any other rules that reduce the Damage characteristic of an attack</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Noble Exemplar ability" typeId="712b-eaec-1af0-e425">While an ARMIGER-CLASS model is under the effects of this model&apos;s Bondsman ability, each time that ARMIGER-CLASS model makes an attack against a unit is within your deployment zone, add 1 to that attack&apos;s hit roll and add 1 to that attack&apos;s wound roll</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Crusade Duty" typeId="bcbb-2bc1-7507-3852">While this model is in your Crusade force, each time you use the Relic or the Repair and Recuperate Requisition, it costs 1 fewer Requisition points to use</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
