            <characteristic name="Noble Exemplar ability" typeId="712b-eaec-1af0-e425">Each time this model uses its Bondsman ability, it can select any &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; ARMIGER-CLASS model on the battlefield for that ability</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Crusade Duty" typeId="bcbb-2bc1-7507-3852">If this unit is part of your Crusade force and you are using the Strategic Reserves rule, you can halve the Command point cost required to place units into Strategic Reserves (rounding fractions down)</characteristic>
