- The bearer cannot be affected by any Bondsman abilities or any Knightly Teachings
- The bearer gain the following ability: THE BASTARD&apos;S HELM (BONDSMAN): In your Command phase, you can select one other friendly &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD) ARMIGER-CLASS model within 12&quot;of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time that ARMIGER-CLASS model makes an attack, add 1 to that attack&apos;s wound roll.</characteristic>
