                              <characteristics>
                                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time you use a Stratagem to affect this model, and each time you use the Command re-roll Stratagem to re-roll a dice roll made for this model, you must spend 1 additional CP or that Stratagem cannot be used.</characteristic>
